# Screenshots from the capture tools (e2e/tools/*.mjs) — regenerate, do not commit.
apps/client/e2e/out

# Scratch probes written by review/analysis runs; the real tools and tests have descriptive
# names, so a leading underscore anywhere means "throwaway, do not commit". Two of these
# already reached a commit via `git add -A`, and one of them broke `pnpm test`.
apps/client/e2e/tools/_*.mjs
apps/client/e2e/tools/__*.mjs
**/__probe*.ts
**/_probe*.ts
**/__dbg*.ts
